# Compiler documentation and TDD

Follow @AGENTS.md as the repository-wide authority.

In particular, read @specs/DOCUMENTATION_STYLE.md before changing technical
documentation or source comments, and follow @specs/TDD_WORKFLOW.md for every
behavior-changing implementation. Use Red–Green–Refactor, preserve unrelated work, and
run the validation commands required by the affected subsystem.
